  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">哈爾探索模組正在從頭改寫（從 MCreator 轉移至 IntelliJ），所有內容皆徹底重製，預計於 2025 年推出以 MCreator 製作的週年紀念版。任何改寫版本的發布時間估計約在 2026 年底或 2027 年初。</span></h1><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/416/612/h.gif\" width=\"1777\" height=\"648\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fhalstudios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/663/660/bisecthosting3.png\" width=\"1128\" height=\"188\"></span></a></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252firon-horse.games%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"color:#f00;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/970/875/ironhorse-banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1830\" height=\"666\"></span></span></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00;font-family:&amp;#x27\">警告：此模組的正式版本可能與先前版本大多不相容，在安裝至模組包或用於生存模式時請謹慎。</span></p><p>進入一個充滿科技、冒險與絕美景緻的蒸氣龐克世界……<strong>哈爾探索模組</strong>是終極的維度模組，魔法與奇蹟正等待著你！</p><p><strong>免責聲明：</strong>本模組目前處於 Alpha 發布階段，屬於<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">開發中作品</span><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">。</span></strong>功能在首次正式發布前可能有所變動。SameDifferent 目前正協助從頭改寫程式碼，以修復錯誤、解決效能問題並擴展功能可能性。更多資訊請加入下方連結的 Discord 伺服器。</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>📖 特色功能：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">- 全新的蒸氣龐克主題維度<strong>藍葉</strong>，透過蒸氣龐克機械進入！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">- 9 個令人驚嘆的全新生態域供你探索！</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">- 可升級的飛天飛船！</span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">- 新的敵人與待發現的</span>建築結構！</p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">- 新武器與盔甲！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>⛏ 入門指南：</strong></span></p><p>要進入此維度，你需要建造一台傳送機，使用<strong>銅礦石</strong>與<strong>青銅礦</strong>合成。這些礦物可透過挖掘<strong>玫瑰銅礦</strong>與<strong>青銅礦</strong>獲得。青銅礦僅生成於巨石中，而玫瑰銅礦可在 y34 以下任何位置生成。建議搭配使用<strong>JEI</strong>與<strong>Sodium Reforged</strong>，因為<strong>本模組對效能要求較高</strong>。更多資訊請參考下方影片。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong style=\"font-size:18px\">⛏ 模組合成表：</strong></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/461/144/hals-exploration-mod-recipes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"1013\"></strong></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong style=\"font-size:18px\">👾 Discord/</strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>社群連結</strong></span><strong style=\"font-size:18px\">：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/407/905/advertisement.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"237\" height=\"482\"></strong></span></p><p>加入我的 Discord 伺服器以追蹤模組開發進度：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/UqtarNpnQJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/UqtarNpnQJ</a><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>🏞 模組展示影片：</strong></span></p><p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ASHORTADUOY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sUZC2kUHmuA?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tNkyjZRJx0w?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/npxiLlbV190?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/FxDccPjFEDo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tIiZvU05rt8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:24px\"><strong>問與答</strong></span></p><p><strong>問：會更新至舊版本嗎？</strong></p><p>答：不會</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>問：會更新至新版本嗎？</strong><br>答：會</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>問：為什麼地面有這麼多不同的方塊？</strong><br>答：這是為了紋理化地面，有時我覺得地面過於單調，且某些地面（例如菌絲土）難以紋理化，因此可能看起來有些突兀，但仍是改進。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>問：我可以在模組包中使用嗎？</strong><br>答：請隨意使用，雖不強制要求標註來源，但我希望你能這麼做，並注意 1.0 以下與 1.0 以上版本之間的不相容性。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>希望這能幫助釐清一些問題！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#800080\">👾 社群影片：</span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080;text-decoration:underline\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QpNrjjFrcO4?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080;text-decoration:underline\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/C90vohoJVtY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080;text-decoration:underline\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rHbjrK7vG5M?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080;text-decoration:underline\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NQ6RZ8Ldmnw?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080;text-decoration:underline\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/b1eSRNfC6Wo?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080;text-decoration:underline\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Vm_N9XUF30A?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080;text-decoration:underline\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vbWHFRh_jL8?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#800080;text-decoration:underline\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/n9_FukBldnc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
